  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Review of Sector Reform Performance Contract  - Skills Development and Matching for Labour Market Needs (4&amp;5 tranches)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objective of this framework contract is to provide a detailed review of the implementation of the EU 2018 &#xBF; 2023 Sector Reform Performance Contract (SRC) on Skills Development and Matching for Labour Market Needs/Skills for Jobs Programme Phase 2 and enable the European Union to use the submitted reports as a tool for monitoring programme implementation and taking decisions on instalment disbursement for the years 2022 &#xBF; 2023 in line with the financing agreement.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
